		}
		{
			dependencies: ["72D090FF4C44DAAD"]
			description: [
				"The tutorials in this modpack heavily reference materials and articles from pioneers on Chinese MC modding sites such as McMod."
				""
				"The KubeJS scripting and modification aspects are largely inspired by discussions, questions, and examples from other researchers in the KubeJS Discord community."
				""
				"Some mod modifications benefit from the open and public code shared generously by mod developers. Their commitment to open-source principles is sincerely appreciated."
				""
				"Certain textures used in this modpack are referenced from other mods. However, their original purposes have been preserved as much as possible to help players recognize their origins. These textures will be gradually replaced in future updates to avoid potential conflicts. Special thanks to the creators of these assets and mods for their excellent ideas and artistic design."
				""
				"The modpack also leverages broader media exposure and certain psychological effects to gain recognition. We appreciate the opportunity provided."
			]
			icon: {
				Count: 1b
				id: "kubejs:flower_heart"
				tag: { }
			}
			id: "64EA255C062BB895"
			shape: "rsquare"
			subtitle: "External thanks"
			tasks: [{
				id: "1B62C7838335B033"
				title: "额外鸣谢"
				type: "checkmark"
			}]
			title: "Special Thanks"
			x: -3.75d
			y: 0.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["0E3B5BC6A471679E"]
			description: [
				"&6Core Feature Implementation :&r"
				""
				"1. Basic organ system implemented"
				"2. Fast registration of organs supported"
				"3. Decoupled organ strategy system"
				"4. Injury event proxy system"
				"5. Activation effects, special effects, and synergy effects implemented"
				"6. Support for extended events from addons such as MoreJs"
				"7. Resource organs and Forbidden organs implemented"
				"8. Organ trinket growth system implemented"
				"9. Partial mod integration organ effects"
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				"&6GUI and Texture :&r"
				""
				"1. Chest cavity GUI textures"
				"2. Quest page UI design"
				"3. Widget and background replacement"
				"4. Partial pages configured with FancyMenu"
				"5. Removed unused buttons and optimized default interactions"
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				"&6Gameplay Content and Balancing :&r"
				""
				"1. Minimal biological compatibility organs added (future focus area)"
				"2. Wares and mod currency system initially completed"
				"3. Main storyline Grand Spell #1 completed"
				"4. Trial of Divine Will completed"
				"5. Majority (70%) of tutorial quests completed"
				"6. Initial main progression completed (40%)"
			]
			hide_dependency_lines: true
			icon: "alexsmobs:potted_flutter"
			id: "37A0FA236DF85027"
			shape: "rsquare"
			subtitle: "Overview of early release version progress status"
			tasks: [{
				id: "248868AC9E4DAAF6"
				type: "checkmark"
			}]
			title: "Current overall development progress：40%"
			x: -3.75d
			y: 1.75d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["37A0FA236DF85027"]
			description: [
				"&6Core Feature Implementation:&r"
				""
				"1. Add compatibility-focused organs"
				"2. Strengthen build-oriented design and enhance organ synergy systems"
				"3. Further improve organ functionality and mod integration"
				"4. Allow organs to be obtainable at earlier progression stages"
				"5. Implement distortion effects"
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				"&6UI and Texture :&r"
				""
				"1. Further optimize in-game texture "
				"2. Attempt full replacement of GUI interfaces"
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				"&6Gameplay Content and Balancing :&r"
				""
				"1. Complete organ compatibility settings for most modded creatures (70%)"
				"2. Add more dynamic difficulty scaling systems"
				"3. Introduce Tetra materials to better match in-game build progression"
				"4. Refine quest system for smoother and better progression flow"
				"5. Add more checkpoint-style quests to create layered progression"
				"6. Introduce additional challenge content"
				"7. Extend main storyline and design additional Grand Magic events"
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				"Most importantly: &6complete non-native localization&r"
			]
			id: "1F2A2EB40A0386CE"
			shape: "rsquare"
			subtitle: "ecessary Progress for Non-Chinese Release (CurseForge Release)"
			tasks: [{
				id: "15FD667B8A05CA80"
				item: "fruitsdelight:lychee_cherry_tea"
				type: "item"
			}]
			title: "Released Version Goals：60%"
			x: -1.25d
			y: 1.75d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["1F2A2EB40A0386CE"]
			description: [
				"Plans often change faster than expected. The content of this modpack is almost &6infinitely expandable&r (at least for this theme), so its development timeline may extend far beyond what I originally anticipated."
				""
				"Any new mod or technical breakthrough could reshape the entire direction and content of the pack. Therefore, the &2“final goal” is not a static endpoint&r, but an ever-evolving unknown that changes almost daily."
				""
				"If you are truly interested in the so-called &6final version&r, you can visit our Github page to view current plans and a more user-friendly Markdown interface."
				""
				"{\"text\":\"Click here to view progress on Github\",\"color\":\"yellow\",\"underlined\":\"true\",\"clickEvent\":{\"action\":\"open_url\",\"value\":\"https://github.com/Yorunina/No-Flesh-Within-Chest\"}}"
			]
			hide_dependent_lines: true
			id: "5D4966C4D48F6E5E"
			shape: "rsquare"
			subtitle: "The expansion of this modpack is limitless, but in the short term, it can be considered complete"
			tasks: [{
				id: "1B6A2462D4392535"
				item: "kubejs:full_mark"
				type: "item"
			}]
			title: "Long-Term Iteration Goals：100%"
			x: 1.25d
			y: 1.75d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["72D090FF4C44DAAD"]
			description: [
				"In the Chinese version, the modpack is named “Brittle Bone Disease”, which corresponds to a real-world condition known as &6Osteogenesis Imperfecta&r."
				""
				"This is a very rare inherited bone disorder, with an incidence of approximately &23 per 100,000&r. Depending on the type of the disease, symptoms can vary: in milder cases, patients may simply experience &cfrequent fractures&r in daily life, while in severe cases, they may suffer &cserious disability&r or even face a &crisk of death&r."
				""
				"As a congenital genetic condition, there are no preventive measures, some cases may even result in death in the womb or during childbirth. After diagnosis, patients can only rely on safe, guided physical activity to increase bone and muscle mass in order to maintain independent daily living. However, there is currently no complete cure. Depending on the causative gene, treatments may include medications such as bisphosphonates, estrogen, calcitonin, and vitamin D3."
				""
				"At present, &6stem cell therapy&r is considered one of the more advanced approaches under study, but it remains in the research stage and is not yet available for clinical use in the near term."
				""
				"This quest encourages players, while enjoying the game, to also pay attention to people living with &2rare diseases&r, and to help reduce their burdens and suffering in any way they can."
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"{\"text\":\"If you would like to learn more about this disease, click here to proceed to Wiki\",\"color\":\"yellow\",\"underlined\":\"true\",\"clickEvent\":{\"action\":\"open_url\",\"value\":\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Osteogenesis_imperfecta\"}}"
				""
				"&6If you are interested in making a donation, you may contact relevant medical institutions.&r"
				""
				"GoCampingTeam sincerely thanks every player for taking the time to read this."
			]
			icon: "irons_spellbooks:frozen_bone"
